            </note>
            <note corresp="#d566-f2" n="2" xml:id="d566-f2-content">
                <p>No record of this meeting has been found.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d566-f3" n="3" xml:id="d566-f3-content">
                <p>The last C–130 left the Congo on December 10. During its 5 months in the Congo,
                    the JTF flew 179 missions (412 sorties carrying
                    7,657 persons and 1,632 tons of cargo).</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d566-f4" n="4" xml:id="d566-f4-content">
